        npcmsg("Not only that, but the types of\n"
               "Pokémon you see will change depending\f"
               "on the types of objects you place.\r"
               "Isn’t it amazing?\n"
               "I will call you using the Pokégear if\f"
               "something else comes up!\r")
    _0599:
